{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-4403e4e1c3e8e6879e1f","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"「풍기패, 일중견매」… 이런 이런, 이 이상 낙원에서 점을 쳐봤는데 나온 게 구삼효라니, 길상은 아니네","speaker":"효광","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["12817512121984818366"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12842200072830596321","15007324092601644853","5676363387127417629","12523900515637182296","11889624800477677762","5959585449427435097","10651397419314756127","15851450043019020740","12210028522359157355","2924990272858236884","16923489272385708715","4532058411371570505","12534678324929174830"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-640d61125ce94efd0972","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"무슨 말인지… 못 알아듣겠어요","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2178787699813511255"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-343e63d32738b5269af8","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"내 사매처럼 솔직하고 학구열 넘치는 아이라 마음에 쏙 드네. 내가 풀이해 주지. 「매」는 작은 별을 뜻해. 한낮에 별이 보이고 별빛이 햇빛을 가리는 건 길조가 아니야","speaker":"효광","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2851814034839388436"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12842200072830596321","15007324092601644853","5676363387127417629","12523900515637182296","11889624800477677762","5959585449427435097","10651397419314756127","15851450043019020740","12210028522359157355","2924990272858236884","16923489272385708715","4532058411371570505","12534678324929174830"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-f16363c6eec32bcf7973","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"게다가 이 괘의 이어지는 구절은 「오른팔이 부러지나, 허물은 없다」거든. 당분간은 아무런 활약도 못 할뿐더러 오히려 자기 자신을 망칠 수도 있어. 털끝 하나만 건드려도 판 전체가 흔들릴 테니, 흥하면 곧 쇠하는 법이지……","speaker":"효광","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9739465153976839720"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12842200072830596321","15007324092601644853","5676363387127417629","12523900515637182296","11889624800477677762","5959585449427435097","10651397419314756127","15851450043019020740","12210028522359157355","2924990272858236884","16923489272385708715","4532058411371570505","12534678324929174830"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-059a3d315d0d3bfc2458","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"듣기에 별로 안 좋은데요","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["5250997301123476465"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-2d711b1965eef8e6249e","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"흉괘예요? 어쩌죠?","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["4709508526006499687"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-600d4fe0b70c2eaa6be4","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"에휴! 내가 해결책을 어떻게 알겠어. 일찌감치 옥궐로 돌아가야겠네!","speaker":"효광","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8881986336792323178"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12842200072830596321","15007324092601644853","5676363387127417629","12523900515637182296","11889624800477677762","5959585449427435097","10651397419314756127","15851450043019020740","12210028522359157355","2924990272858236884","16923489272385708715","4532058411371570505","12534678324929174830"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-aa35b6044c104dd83cc6","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"청작에게 내 말 전해. 빨리 나부를 떠나 나 대신 이상 낙원에 사절로 가라고 해구리. 그럼 그렇게 알아, 난 갈게","speaker":"효광","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10803202835313676095"],"speakerHashCandidates":["12842200072830596321","15007324092601644853","5676363387127417629","12523900515637182296","11889624800477677762","5959585449427435097","10651397419314756127","15851450043019020740","12210028522359157355","2924990272858236884","16923489272385708715","4532058411371570505","12534678324929174830"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-b7ef54b1dbe947f273ac","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"잠깐, 해구리…?","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["17380475473223478996"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-ea362d69b16d051fd9e0","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"너구리 말투가 널 배신했거든","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["8902211348644163859"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-68703704155eeb4f9408","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"사장님, 참 무드도 없으셔라. 나도 육효를 꿰뚫고 있어서, 점치는 건 효 사장한테 절대 안 밀려구리!","speaker":"차차구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["1765727413704776080"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8926345543983934462"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-e8c2b35b5a7c36e4929c","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"하지만 요즘 사람들은 다 그렇잖아. 효 사장 분장을 하지 않고 대뜸 그런 말을 꺼냈다면, 다들 진지하게 받아들이지 않았을 거야","speaker":"차차구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3517710607761232568"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8926345543983934462"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-218a0b68e85f4ac31d50","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"괜찮아. 비록 속마음을 들켰다 하더라도, 효 사장님의 귀한 말씀 덕분에 낙원에 대한 내 깨달음이 조금이나마 승화되었으니까……","speaker":"차차구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2611524415975332917"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8926345543983934462"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-6604e205e7ee3c367fb8","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"듣자 하니 캐릭터를 흉내 내는 다른 리리들은 발각된 후에 사장님과 한바탕 싸운다더라고. 나야 그럴 마음은 없지만… 굳이 유별나게 행동했다간 나중에 동료들에게 미운털이 박히겠지","speaker":"차차구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10865956086804448638"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8926345543983934462"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-b156715b11dc8963d885","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"사장님, 미안한데 아무래도 나랑 한 수 겨뤄야겠어!","speaker":"차차구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15833844745776499267"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8926345543983934462"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-13d36aa5d52a90e34da3","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"휴, 이걸로 어떻게 둘러댈 수는 있겠네. 사장님과 겨뤄보다니, 정말 영광이야","speaker":"차차구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["12293381399804170656"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8926345543983934462"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-6a7e350711411189ea37","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"「물과 불은 상극이니… 그 뜻이 서로 맞지 않도다」. 흠흠, 사장 자리를 둘러싼 다툼은 늘 이런 법이지, 이 몸은 벌써 창작의 영감이 샘솟는 냄새를 맡았다고……","speaker":"차차구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6019992101204356945"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8926345543983934462"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-79a8d584e02fad5020a4","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","text":"——난 지금 바로 두 사장님이 맞붙는 이야기를 구상하러 가볼게. 바이바이, 사장님! 내가 위대한 작품을 창작해 낼 수 있길 응원해 줘~","speaker":"차차구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"차차구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7723880055029326626"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8926345543983934462"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p38150","title":"변신의 달인 너구리","page":"百变狸猫","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-4403e4e1c3e8e6879e1f","rowId":"other-interaction-p38150-4403e4e1c3e8e6879e1f","missionId":"interaction-p38150","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","sceneId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","scene":"차차구리","contextId":"wiki-context-5d05ad1d0eec7474c5e20ed3","page":"百变狸猫","revision":97705,"location":[0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-640d61125ce94efd0972","rowId":"other-interaction-p38150-640d61125ce94efd0972","missionId":"interaction-p38150","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","sceneId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","scene":"차차구리","contextId":"wiki-context-5d05ad1d0eec7474c5e20ed3","page":"百变狸猫","revision":97705,"location":[0,1,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["d028af93fee6-0"],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-343e63d32738b5269af8","rowId":"other-interaction-p38150-343e63d32738b5269af8","missionId":"interaction-p38150","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","sceneId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","scene":"차차구리","contextId":"wiki-context-5842aab076aa0ffedcfe1d49","page":"百变狸猫","revision":97705,"location":[0,2],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-interaction-p38150-f16363c6eec32bcf7973"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-f16363c6eec32bcf7973","rowId":"other-interaction-p38150-f16363c6eec32bcf7973","missionId":"interaction-p38150","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","sceneId":"s53c9eb121faa2f71","scene":"차차구리","contextId":"wiki-context-5842aab076aa0ffedcfe1d49","page":"百变狸猫","revision":97705,"location":[0,3],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-inter